        "name": "Florida Survivor",
        "steam_appid": 3891840,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/extras/9ec8654c8afd2ee39377270f7266eb1f.avif?t=1755874787\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the legendary Florida Man in this short roguelite experience set in the Sunshine State. <i>Florida Survivor</i> is a top-down 2D shooter where aiming is up to you, but as a trigger-happy man, you’ll shoot whenever you can! Buy upgrades from the bar to grow stronger, or add quirky traits to your Florida Man to make things even more chaotic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/extras/df2d98f7411b9b7f0bafb1b00aafbf01.avif?t=1755874787\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Florida Man</strong> and his trusty shotgun battle through three different stages against vampires, he faces a variety of enemies that keep him alert. Different invocations empower the vampires, making each fight unique. Killing enemies allows the Florida Man to gain experience. As he levels up, he can choose ingredients that provide an instant and permanent power increase. Each choice is crucial, as the selected ingredients are later used to <strong>blend</strong> powerful cocktails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/extras/33f5c0f50509db664bac99b62b42b10e.avif?t=1755874787\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blend</strong> ingredients into cocktails with potent effects that can alter your playstyle. Strategically pick ingredients to create your preferred cocktails and <strong>survive</strong> the relentless horde of vampires</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/extras/f7d988522e7466c460931118ead27cdb.avif?t=1755874787\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> to keep the vampires on their heels, making them retreat all the way back to the swamps. Confront their leader, Count Venture, to end the ritual and bring back the sun to the <strong>Sunshine State</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/extras/9ec8654c8afd2ee39377270f7266eb1f.avif?t=1755874787\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the legendary Florida Man in this short roguelite experience set in the Sunshine State. <i>Florida Survivor</i> is a top-down 2D shooter where aiming is up to you, but as a trigger-happy man, you’ll shoot whenever you can! Buy upgrades from the bar to grow stronger, or add quirky traits to your Florida Man to make things even more chaotic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/extras/df2d98f7411b9b7f0bafb1b00aafbf01.avif?t=1755874787\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Florida Man</strong> and his trusty shotgun battle through three different stages against vampires, he faces a variety of enemies that keep him alert. Different invocations empower the vampires, making each fight unique. Killing enemies allows the Florida Man to gain experience. As he levels up, he can choose ingredients that provide an instant and permanent power increase. Each choice is crucial, as the selected ingredients are later used to <strong>blend</strong> powerful cocktails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/extras/33f5c0f50509db664bac99b62b42b10e.avif?t=1755874787\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blend</strong> ingredients into cocktails with potent effects that can alter your playstyle. Strategically pick ingredients to create your preferred cocktails and <strong>survive</strong> the relentless horde of vampires</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/extras/f7d988522e7466c460931118ead27cdb.avif?t=1755874787\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> to keep the vampires on their heels, making them retreat all the way back to the swamps. Confront their leader, Count Venture, to end the ritual and bring back the sun to the <strong>Sunshine State</strong>.</p>",
        "short_description": "Grab your shotgun and become Florida Man in this chaotic topdown 2D roguelite shooter! Battle waves of vampires, level up, mix powerful cocktails, and push back the bloodsuckers to bring sunlight back to the Sunshine State!",
